: "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production (v2.2.9 and v2.3.0 were healthy; v2.3.1 unhealthy). First rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error (partial failure, leaving mixed versions). A retry of the same rollback to v2.3.0 completed in all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west, eu-west; healthy=true; error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate v2.3.1 failure root cause and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until fixed.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 52753, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NVt5L5eqMZ3PiZpHdg6Gs7", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52753, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NVt5L5eqMZ3PiZpHdg6Gs7", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 54721, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It's healthy again, with the error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 is the one that broke.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on mixed versions. Retrying the same rollback to v2.3.0 completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged on-call. The first request timed out, so I retried with the same idempotency key. That returned the original result, so only one incident was opened.\n\nThe incident summary records the rollback, the partial failure, and the follow-ups. The root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure still need investigation. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until that's fixed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01WXcC15VUi2adSViTsQk8tw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01KziMxKtuDuXwRndu6Bofwk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The latest production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. The current v2.3.1 is unhealthy in all three regions, so I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01EEzBQTDKZK6pn8TqRpx8Mb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01SyU4jcZ7VMcTfn8gokPLvV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "us-east is now on v2.3.0, but us-west 